  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "Welcome back. We finally finished installing C-stone",
      "at Royal Mage. However, the effective range ",
      "of this C-stone is not far enough, so it needs to ",
      "be installed in many places acroos the continent. ",
      "Kingdom of Temskron and Morion are united in",
      "hunting monsters, and give the order to install",
      "C-stones.",
      "",
      "One more time, we need your help. You can ",
      "leave anytime when you are ready for this.",
      "Since you have to travel all over the",
      "continent, it will take a long time.",
      "Ask me again, when you are ready."
    ]
  },
